Agent Progress Card

Maintainer: chengxianhe

This standalone distribution extracts the desktop-card and WeChat extensions
previously developed in a min-agent checkout. Its source snapshot originated
from extension commit af1f73e5ac97083f45346d1deeccc814abd43bcb.
The original demo engine, web UI, model adapters and MCP demo are not included.
This repository starts its own Git history and has no upstream runtime dependency.

